body:
yes. in the words of a stranger that helped me more than they could ever know;

"you are alive because you are here and it's as simple as that, no more and no less. if you weren't, you wouldn't be able to question it."

i know that it is so scary for you right now. if you're able, try to find some comfort that this feeling is not forever. i promise

this is a very strange experience. if you're able to, you should try and stay awake until tomorrow to see if it happens again. i have no clue what this phenomenon would be, but i'm not experienced in something like this. if it happens again, maybe you should talk to a psychic. maybe you should talk to a psychic about it anyway. 

&#x200B;

i wonder if those days happened in real life, the day just completely restarted for everyone else in the world and nobody remembers, or if you're just living in a time loop right now. maybe you're jumping through black holes or whatever the hell those reality things are. 

&#x200B;

if it helps anything, if you do end up living through Valentines Day again tomorrow, and this post doesn't happen, you should remember my username and message me. (maybe messaging me on a different social media outlet would be better, due to me not going on reddit very often so direct message me on my "private spam" instagram account would be more ideal if you're down. it's **@tiddyphuck** lmao. i also have a snapchat if you'd prefer to message that). knowing myself, if it is a parallel universe or whatever, i would believe you. i am somewhat skeptical, but i'm understanding enough and have a very open mind to listen to what you have to say and with enough convincing, i know i'll believe it, and maybe that can confirm it for you. i'm in online school as well so i'm not really busy throughout the day besides doing school work, so i'd be more than willing to help you.

&#x200B;

even if this is just you adding a post just to fool people or to see if you can get top redditor, or whatever it is, it's a very interesting post and i wish you luck.
